{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家將通常由巖漿產生的氣體證據與在火星表面新發現的裂縫聯繫起來，指出火星可能存在火山活動。這一發現可謂尋找生命過程中的好消息，因為要使微生物免受火星表面嚴寒温度的侵害，就需要持續的熱源。11月4日，相關研究成果發表於《科學進展》。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585644.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.395051+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"fced7c720040efd83ac737a68f8d9540905cca19d558c251d3230b710cb5110e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}